    "created_at": "2024-01-08T23:07:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-08T23:07:12Z",
    "body": "> It is clipped internally. Confusingly, it's [explicitly set](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/resources/html.css;l=977;drc=95f430edbf3e33525b4ac122875360b8d44c0630) to `overflow:visible` in the UA stylesheet.\r\n\r\nI dug the blame for that and it's https://codereview.chromium.org/751453003. That predates overflow: clip, and changing that to `overflow: clip !important` should be relatively low risk AIUI.",
