    "updated_at": "2024-01-09T10:40:16Z",
    "body": "You mean for listbox or non-listbox select? For non-listbox, you're seeing the border / padding in the UA sheet. The select doesn't get clipped, but it clips its contents, that's what the overflow property does generally.",
